                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Algorithm is a logic game that lets you control a device(?) from the start to finish line. You have to first plot the path that your device should follow and then control a speed of the device with a meter. There will be obstacles on the way to the finish line of course, to make your life difficult. While it's a nice concept and the music is great, the game play is not gripping enough and it gets boring quickly. You have to trial and error a lot before passing certain levels. I got stuck on level 15 and decided to quit.",
